@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:记录检查与诊断</u>\n<u>控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:健康复核</u>" as Review
participant "<u>:病历</u>" as Record
participant "<u>:检查所见</u>" as Finding
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-10办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-10办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Visit : 核对接诊责任(执行者)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
K -> Visit : 确认实际接诊(责任牙医及实际开始时间)
activate Visit
Visit -> Review : 提供当次复核(当前就诊)
activate Review
Review --> Visit : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Review
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
K -> Visit : 记录检查诊断(正文、当前版本)
activate Visit
Visit -> Record : 更新未签署正文(主诉、诊断、处理意见)
activate Record
Record -> Finding : 保留检查所见(牙位牙面及检查内容)
activate Finding
Finding --> Record : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Finding
Record --> Visit : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Record
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Finding
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
